return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-27T08:44:12+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-27T08:44:12+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','Multilingual WordPress, one post per language: linked translations of posts, pages, categories, media text, widgets and the site title, with your old Tranzly translations imported.'=>'WordPress mai harsuna da yawa, post ɗaya ga kowane harsha: fassarori masu alaƙa na posts, shafuka, rukuni, rubutun kafofin watsa labarai, widgets da taken shafin, tare da tsofaffin fassarorin ku na Tranzly da aka shigo da su.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Masu samar da AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar ChatGPT. Mai amfani a kowane fanni mai kyau.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu samar da Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubuce-rubuce kuma suna da hankali wajen yin la\'akari.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kamfanin AI na Turai tare da sauri, samfura masu rahusa.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfura masu rahusa wadanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da shirya lamba.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi lokacin da ba a saita wani abu na musamman ba)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutawa da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassarar','Code and CSS'=>'Lamba da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Ana raba waɗannan saitunan ta kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An rufe makullan ku a cikin bayanan wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma ana tura su ne kawai ga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa - ba za a taɓa tura su zuwa gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku madogara, don haka kuna biyan mai bayar da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Kowane ɗayan waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara ƙarin daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 na 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke dace da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli sannan ka kofe shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Saka shi a ƙasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye ka gwada". Muna tura ƙaramin buƙatu guda ɗaya don tabbatar yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis na buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara kuɗi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adiireshi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Maɓallin da aka adana ya ƙare da …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓaɓɓe)','API key'=>'Maɓullin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu bada sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Mabuɗi','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'An adana ta ta hanyar sabon sigar plugin: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma sake shigar da maɓallin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaron shafin). Sake shigar da shi.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa shi ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa - gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin karshe ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane samfurin da za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ta nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sake sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Kara abin koyi da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri a yau? A mannainiini sunansa daidai domin amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin abubuwan da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar fasalin ƙari yana kawo sabon abu.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Haka zalika, bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin abubuwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar zazzagewa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafi, babu komai game da abun cikin ku. Jerin yana da sa hannu, kuma ana watsi da jerin da ya kasa gwajin sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An duba ta ƙarshe %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a bincika yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'an riga an sabunta','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'an saukar da shi ya gaza binciken sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da shi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin ku na biyan kuɗi','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis din ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin aikinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafi shi, ba tare da guraben sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko a liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyan sunan samfurin, alal misali kamar yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An kara %s. Zabi shi a karkashin "Wane samfurin za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An bincika: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI da ka adana ba (an sauya maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi wani samfuri ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta plugin ba.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga sabis na AI naka ba. Tabbatar cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar yanar gizonka (ba za a iya isa ga sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba daga wani shafin da aka karbi bakuncinsa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Ba a iya samun %s a wannan shafin ba. Duba shafin su na halin yaki; idan yana aiki, mai masaukin bakin ka na iya toshe haɗin waje, ko kuma adreshin ba daidai ba ne.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin ku ba. Yana iya zama an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi, ko ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma liƙa shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan roƙo na madannin ku. Madannin wataƙila ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusun ku na buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a samun samfurin "%1$s" daga %2$s don makullin ku. Zaɓi wani samfurin daban a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s na takaita saurin da maɓallin ku zai iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti guda sannan a ƙara gwadawa, ko kuma a ƙara iyakar ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsaloli a yanzu (akwai matsalar katsewar sabis ko cunkoso a ɓangarensu). Babu wata matsala game da saitunanka. Sake gwadawa nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Aikace-aikacen AI ya gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na Musamman (mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye maɓalli don wannan mai bada sabis ɗin da farko.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Makullin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu ba a kansa. Ƙara samfurin da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinka suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani da ku damar amfani da AI a wannan shafin ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara ta a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Littafin shiga, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki ga AI da ake amfani da ita ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudin suna da kusan zatowa, an lissafa su daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da babu wani sanannen farashin shi yana ƙidaya azaman sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan watan: buƙatun %1$s, kusan %2$s.','When'=>'Lokaci','Who'=>'Wane','Used for'=>'Yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Wajen Tokens / Waje','About'=>'Game da','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi buƙatun AI ba tukuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyaka da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kuɗi ta kowane wata (dalar US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi ba komai don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kusan farashin ya kai hakan.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi da babu komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Cire daukacin zabubbuka domin ba wa kowa damar amfani da AI wanda zai iya amfani da sassan plugin din. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adoke da izini an adana.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Wannan harshe ba ya cikin harsunan da wannan shafin ke amfani da su.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Dole fassarar ta zama iri ɗaya da ta asali.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Zaɓi wani daga cikin sauran harsunan shafin yanar gizon.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Rubutun allo na admin ba ya nan a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Zaɓi harshe','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ya zama haruffa kanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, ya fara da harafi, kuma kada ya sanya wa plugin ɗin suna.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" ba lambar yare ba ne. Yi amfani da wani locale na WordPress kamar fr_FR ko de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Lisƙa aƙalla harshe ɗaya.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Ba a baka izinin fassara wannan abu ba.','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Wannan abu yana da fasali a cikin wannan harshe tuni.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Ba a samun wannan injin fassara a wannan shafin ba.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini daban-daban ga kowane harshe, madadin atomatik, da iyakokin kashe kudi sune fasalolin Tranzly Pro.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Dole kowane harshen ya zama daya daga cikin harsunan shafin, tare da injin da ke akwai.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Jerin madadin na iya sanya suna ne kawai ga injinan da ake da su.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Wani iyaka na wata-wata adadi ne a cikin US dollars, sifili ko fiye da haka, don injin da yake a sama.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Abubuwan da aka fi so na fassara da kuma sautin magana a kowane harshe fasali ne na Tranzly Pro. Jerin abubuwan da kada a fassara kyauta ne.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Dole ne a raba shigarwar ƙamus bisa ga ɗaya daga cikin harsunan shafin.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Ana saita sautin ne ga kowane harshen shafin: tsarin ladabi na asali, sama ko kasa, tare da karin umarni na zabi.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Darajar %s ba ta cikin abubuwan da aka yarda da su ba.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Babu layin baya a wannan shafin.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Ana gudanar da aikin fassara a matsayin mutumin da ya kaddamar da shi, don haka dole ne mai amfani ya shiga tsarin.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Babu abin da aka ba ka izinin fassara a cikin wannan zabi.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Wannan abu ba wani bangare bane na aikin fassara.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin canza wannan fassarar ba.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Rungiyar wannan abu tana da nau\'in %1$s riga (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Ba zai yiwu abu ya zama fassarar kansa ba.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Wannan abu fassara ce ta wani abu daban. A cire haɗin farko.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana hanyar fassara ba.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara wannan rubutu a nan ba.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara rubutun kafofin watsa labarai a nan ba.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Ana iya buga fassarar ko a adana ta a matsayin daftari.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin buga irin wannan abun ciki ba.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Wannan abu an riga an rubuta shi a wannan harshen.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Wannan fassarar mutum ne ya gyara ta (ko kuma aka shigo da ita), don haka tana da kariya. Buɗe ta don sake fassara ta.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Ba a saita injin fassara ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don ɗaya a cikin Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Ba a saita injin fassarar nan ba tukuna: da farko a ƙara maɓallinsa.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Ana fassara rubutun iri ɗaya ta wani aiki yanzu haka; wannan abun zai yi amfani da waccan amsar.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Babu wani injinin fassarar da zai iya ɗaukar wannan abu.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injiniya bai dawo da fassarar kowane bangare na wannan abu ba. Ba a canza komai ba.','AI model'=>'Samfurin AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Samfurin AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s na fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ka yi amfani da wani injin daban.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Shafinka bai iya isa ga %s ba. Tabbatar cewa yana iya yin haɗin waje, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin API ɗinka ba. Duba maɓallin da ke cikin Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Asusunka na %s ya ƙare ko kuma ya ƙare ma\'aunin kuɗinsa. Cika shi da su, ko kuma ka yi amfani da wata injin ɗin.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s ya buƙaci mu rage gudu. Za a sake gwadawa ta atomatik.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Wannan rubutu yana da tsayi sosai ga %s a lokaci guda. Raba abubuwan da ke ciki, ko kuma yi amfani da wani inji daban.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s ya ki fassar wannan abun ciki. Gwada wata injin ɗin, ko ka fassara shi da hannu.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s baya fassara wannan harshe. Zaɓi wani injin daban don shi.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'An kai ga iyakar kashe kudi na wannan wata na %s, don haka babu wani abu da aka kara turawa zuwa gare shi. Ƙara iyakar a Tranzly → Engines, ko kuma jira har zuwa wata mai zuwa.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Fassarar tare da %s ta gaza saboda dalilin da Tranzly bai iya ganewa ba. Ga cikakken bayanin a kasa.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dole idin injini ya zama ƙananan baƙaƙe, lamba, da kuma alamar raba kalma (hyphens).','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'maɓallin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Har yanzu ba a haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda hakan ke da mahimmanci don hana kunnawa ba tare da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani na WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusun ajiyar','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusun ku sannan ku sake ƙaddamar da fom ɗin abokin tarayya.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna so ku haɗa %1$s cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunyar Kyauta ta Farko','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'kunna lasisi a nan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fat za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin da ka karɓa a cikin imel ɗin nan da nan bayan siyan:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunyar lasisi a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar da ake biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna ta don fara amfani da abubuwan %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar da ake biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je %2$s don kunna shi kuma a fara amfani da fa\'idodin %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunyar da fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An kunna asusun ku cikin nasara tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yanki daban','Add-Ons'=>'Abubuwan da za a iya ƙarawa','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ƙarin Abubuwa na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya loda jerin kari ba. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kaɗan.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙarin abu ne na musamman na biya kawai. Dole ne ka fara siyan lasisi kafin ka kunna plugin ɗin.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An nasarar sayen %s Add-on.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An ciyar da tsarin Add-on ɗin ka na %s zuwa babban mataki cikin nasara.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An cire %s kyauta cikin nasara. Tunda ƙarin yana da alaƙa ne kawai da tsarin biyan kuɗi, an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kana son amfani da shi a nan gaba, dole ne ka sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya gudanar da %s ba ba tare da fasalin ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai ina sanar da ku cewa ana dauko bayanan kari na %s daga wani sabar na waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki na na\'urar %s','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshin %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin haɗin gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Saboda keta sharuddan haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusun haɗin gwiwarku na wani dan lokaci. Idan kuna da wata tambaya, da fatan za a tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusun abokin tarayyarka na wani ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi buƙatar ku ta zama abokin ciniki na %1$s! Shiga yankinku na abokan ciniki a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amince da roƙon ku a yanzu. Don Allah a sake gwadawa bayan kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntube ku da karin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s biyan gurbin sa ido bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Alaka','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisin ku ya ƙare, har yanzu za ku iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar amfani da fasalulluka na %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zaran lasisin ku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin ƙima.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Har yanzu kuna iya jin daɗ તમામ abubuwan da ke cikin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na %2$s ba, Haka ma tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da ingantawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan kyautarka ta %1$s, biya kaɗan kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yardika & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Canza Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Dukkan Bukatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'uka','allow'=>'ba da izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Ka riga ka yarda da shiga cikin tsarin bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin tsarin bibiyar amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadin','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kowace Shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin da ba a san wanda ya bayar ba','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Yi amfani da shi a kan duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Yi amfani da shi a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Yi amana don zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince & Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Don Allah ka gaya mana dalili domin mu inganta.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel da ka yi amfani da shi don haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake tura maka maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel din da ka yi amfani da shi yayin siyayya kuma za mu sake turo maka da lambar lasisin.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa da ainihin asusun mai lasisin.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'An ingantaccen ID na samfurin.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ka da ingantaccen lasisi don samun damar shiga sigar gaba da ɗaya.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigar da kaya ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka zabi shiga.','Premium version already active.'=>'An riga an kunna sigar Premium.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sabon fasalin kari na musamman.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin "Serviceware" ne wanda hakan ke nufin ba shi da sigar lambar kuɗi ta musamman.','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta Kanta','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa ta atomatik a cikin:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Matsayi','Awesome'=>'Mai kyau','based on %s'=>'dangane da %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadan mu kuma ku sami ɗan kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin sigar da ka shigar na %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi cikin kintatawa, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a shafukan samarwa. An gargabe ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An biya %s','Billing'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biyan Kuɗi & Lissafin Kuɗi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana kullewa','Blog ID'=>'Lambar Blog','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Eh - adireshin biyun nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Haɗe','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kamfani','Buy license'=>'Sayen lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka/ki da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon ma) - kana/kina son soke %2$s din ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai hana shiga cikin duk wasu abubuwa masu inganci nan take. Kana da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke rajistar','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun mabudin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canza lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An tura sakon imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne mai imel ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Na gode da tabbatar da canjin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canza Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canja Tsarin Aiki','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku canja wurin mallakar asusun ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Canjin tarihin abubuwa','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ka karɓi imel ɗin ba, ka gwada duba babban fayil ɗin da ba a buƙata ba ko kuma ka bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zaɓi har shafin / shafukan yanar gizo %s domin kunna lasisin.','City'=>'Birni','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ka\'idar API Cache','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Wankakken Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da plugin din ba tare da nuna suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna domin ganin sharhi da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'Adireshin imel na abokin cinikina shine %s','Code'=>'Lambar asiri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kaso %s lokacin da abokin ciniki ya siya sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka wuce kwanaki 30 kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'kammala rajista','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Karɓe kowane sabuntawa mai mahimmanci','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Na gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista domin karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress yanayin muhalli. Wannan zai taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma mafi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yi rajista don samun sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & siffofi, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci na musamman, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, ba komai! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki da kyau sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ku taɓa rasa muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ku taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙata ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna matukar farin ciki da gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin cibiyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin ko shafuka %s a cikin hanyar sadarwa waɗanda har yanzu ke buƙatar kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A yayin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin/shafukan yanar gizo %d da har yanzu suke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana son amfani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah shigar da madogaran lasisin ka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunna shi.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, zaka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya a shafin Account na matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s dinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar kun gama, kashe %s sannan ku sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓe mu','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kana son mu tuntube ka game da sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da tayi lokaci-lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Yi hakuri game da rashin jin dadi da aka samu kuma muna nan don taimaka muku idan kun ba mu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntube Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Don Allah tuntube mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Don Allah a tuntube mu da wannan sakon:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu ba da gudummawa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Muna amfani da dakin karatu na PHP cURL don kiran API, wanda shahararren dakin karatu ne kuma yawanci ana shigar da shi kuma an kunna shi kai tsaye. Abin baƙin ciki shine, ba a kunna cURL ba (ko kuma an kashe shi) a kan uwar garken ku.','data'=>'bayanai','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'An kunna yanayin gyara kuskure cikin nasara kuma za a kashe shi ta atomatik cikin mintuna 60. Hakanan zaka iya kashe shi da wuri ta danna "Tsaya Gyara Kuskure" mahaɗin.','Date'=>'Ranana','Deactivate'=>'Kashe Aiki','Deactivate the free version'=>'Kashe sigar kyauta','Deactivate License'=>'Kashe Lasisi','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kashe lasisin ku zai hana duk wani abubuwa na musamman, amma zai ba da damar kunna lasisin a wani shafin daban. Shin kuna da tabbas kuna son ci gaba?','Deactivation'=>'Kashewa','Yes - %s'=>'Ee - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Aika & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kashewa ko cire %s zai kashe lasisin ta atomatik, wanda za ku iya amfani da shi a wani shafin.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Idan kana da lokaci, don Allah sanar da mu dalilin da ya sa kake %s','Debug Log'=>'Log din Rarrabewa','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Gyara kuskure','delegate'=>'ba da iko','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Idan ka danna shi, za a mika wannan hukuncin ga masu gudanar da shafukan.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Ba da izini ga masu gudanar da shafin','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Ba wa Ma\'aikatan Shafin Iko & Ci gaba','Delegating, please wait'=>'Ana rarrabawa, da fatan za a jira','verbDelete'=>'Goge','Delete All Accounts'=>'Goge Duk Asusun','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Shin kana da tabbas kana son goge duk bayanan Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Bayani','Details'=>'Bayani','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'da alama key ɗin da ka shigar bai yi daidai da bayanan mu ba.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Bayanan Gwaji','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Ana kashe yanayin tambarin alamar fari','Disconnect'=>'Cire Haɗi','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Kuna da tabbas cewa kuna son ci gaba da cire haɗin?','If you wish to cancel your