 Ci gaba','Opt Out'=>'Fita daga ciki','Sharing diagnostic data with %s helps to provide functionality that\'s more relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break your website, and recognize which languages & regions the plugin should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanan bincike tare da %s yana taimakawa wajen samar da ayyuka masu dacewa da yanar gizon ku, gujewa rashin dacewar sigar WordPress ko PHP wacce za ta iya lalata yanar gizon ku, da gane harsuna da yankunan da ya kamata a fassara tare da daidaita plugin ɗin zuwa gare su.','Sharing your name and email allows us to keep you in the loop about new features and important updates, warn you about security issues before they become public knowledge, and send you special offers.'=>'Raba sunanka da imel ɗinka yana ba mu damar sanar da kai game da sababbin abubuwa da muhimman sabuntawa, gargadin ka game da batutuwan tsaro kafin su zama sanannun jama\'a, da kuma tura maka tayi na musamman.','Diagnostic data will no longer be sent from %1$s to %2$s.'=>'Ba za a sake aika bayanan bincike daga %1$s zuwa %2$s ba.','Opt in to make "%s" better!'=>'Yi rijista don inganta "%s"!','Opting in'=>'Ana yin rajista','Opting out'=>'Fita daga ciki','For ongoing compatibility with your website, you can optionally allow %s to:'=>'Don dorewa da jituwa da gidan yanar gizon ku, za ku iya ba %s izini ba dole ba ne su:','Other'=>'Sauran','Plugin installer section titleOther Notes'=>'Sauran Bayani','Owner Email'=>'Imel din Mai Gida','Owner ID'=>'ID Mai Mallaka','Owner Name'=>'Sunan Mai Mallaka','Paid add-on must be deployed to Freemius.'=>'Dole ne a tura ƙarin aikin da aka biya kuɗi zuwa Freemius.','as file/folder pathPath'=>'Hanyarta','Payments'=>'Biyaɗa','Payouts are in USD and processed monthly via PayPal.'=>'Biyaɗa suna cikin USD kuma ana aiwatar da su kowane wata ta hanyar PayPal.','PayPal account email address'=>'Adireshin imel na asusun PayPal','PayPal email address is required.'=>'Ana buƙatar adireshin imel na PayPal.','PCI compliant'=>'Mai yarda da PCI','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Duba Bayanin Matsala','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'Sigogin WordPress da PHP, yaren shafin yanar gizo da taken shafi','To avoid breaking your website due to WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Don guje wa lalata yanar gizon ku saboda rashin jituwa tsakanin WordPress ko sigar PHP, kuma ku gane harsuna da yankunan da ya kamata a fassara %s kuma a daidaita su da su.','View License Essentials'=>'Duba Muhimman Abubuwan Lasisi','Homepage URL, %s version, SDK version'=>'URL na shafi na farko, %s version, SDK version','To let you manage & control where the license is activated and ensure %s security & feature updates are only delivered to websites you authorize.'=>'Domin ba da damar ka sarrafa & daidaita inda aka kunna lasisin kuma a tabbatar an aika sabuntawar tsaro & fasali na %s kawai zuwa shafukan yanar gizo da ka ba da izini.','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Na yanzu %s & nau\'ikan SDK, kuma idan suna aiki ko ba a shigar da su ba','Is active, deactivated, or uninstalled'=>'Yana aiki, an kashe shi, ko an cire shi','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Duba Lissafin Fਲugins & Jigo-jigo','Newsletter'=>'Wasiƙar labarai','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Sabuntawa, sanarwa, tallace-tallace, babu spam','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Duba Cikakken Bayanin Asali','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Sunan mai amfani na WordPress: sunan farko & na ƙarshe, da adireshin imel','Never miss important updates, get security warnings before they become public knowledge, and receive notifications about special offers and awesome new features.'=>'Karka taba rasa muhimman sabuntawa, sami gargaɗin tsaro kafin su zama sanannun jama\'a, kuma ka karɓi sanarwa game da tayi na musamman da sabbin abubuwa masu ban sha\'awa.','