zon ku, guje wa rashin jituwa na sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata yanar gizon, da kuma gane wancan harsuna & yankuna waɗanda ya kamata a fassara da kuma daidaita %s a kansu.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Domin haka za ku iya sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s bai kuma aiki ba.','Subscription'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'Za a riƙa tura muhimman bayanai na lasisi lokaci-lokaci daga %1$s zuwa %2$s domin bincika sabuntawar tsaro da abubuwa masu amfani, tare da tabbatar da cewa lasisinka yana aiki.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ake da shi.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Domin tabbatar da dacewa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da shigar da plugins da jigogi naka.','Trial'=>'Gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Hali na %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Babban Bayanin %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Eh, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don dalilin gwaji, mataki, ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kana da lasisi na %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Za a tura muku da imel din tabbatarwa na %1$s zuwa akwatin imel dinku a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar kun danna maballin da ke cikin wannan imel don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'ana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'awowi','license'=>'lasisi','optional'=>'na zaɓi ba','products'=>'kayayyaki','skip'=>'tsallake','subscription'=>'rijista','trial'=>'gwaji','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayayyaki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisi','close a windowDismis