. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana ba da sigogin Beta ga shigarwar Pro masu lasisi waɗannan da ke haɗa da asusunsu. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Save settings'=>'Ajiye saituna','First engine that is set up'=>'Injin na farko da aka saita','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'An adana maɓallin. An adana shi a boye kuma ba za a sake nuna shi ba.','Engine settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan injin.','Glossary saved.'=>'An adana ƙamus ɗin.','Your keys'=>'Makullan ku','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly na kiran ayyukan fassara ta amfani da asusun ku na kanku. Ana adana maɓallan a rufe a cikin bayanan bayananku kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa sabis ɗin da suke ciki. Ana saita maɓallan samfurin AI a cikin saitunan AI.','%s API key'=>'%s Makullin API','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'An adana: %s. Shigar da sabon maɓalli don maye gurbinsa, ko a adana fanko don cire shi.','No key saved.'=>'Ba a adana maɓalli ba.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Yankin Azure (bar shi a fanko don albarkatun duniya)','Save key'=>'Adana maɓalli','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Bincika yawan amfani na da DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'An yi amfani da haruffa %1$s daga cikin %2$s a wannan lokacin na biyan kuɗi.','Which engine translates'=>'Wanne injini ne ke fassara','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Ba a saita wani inji ba tukuna. Ajiye madogara a sama (ko a saita samfurin AI) don fara fassara.','Default engine'=>'Injin tsohuwa (tsohuwar injin)','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Wani injiniya daban ga kowane harshe, madadin mai zuwa ta atomatik, da iyakokin kashe kuɗi na wata-wata fasaloli ne na Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Injin don %s','The default engine'=>'Injin tsohuwar akawa','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Idan wani inji ya gaza ko ya kai iyaka, ka gwada waɗannan na gaba, a cikin wannan tsari','Monthly spending caps'=>'Iyaka kudaden wata-wata','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Lokacin da injiniya ya kai ga iyakarsa, ba a aika masa da wani abu ba har sai wata mai zuwa kuma rahoton fassarar da ba ta yi nasara ba yana bayanin dalilin. Bar shi babu komai don rashin iyaka.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (wanda aka kashe a wannan wata: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Ajiye manyan haruffa','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Ƙamus da kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Kada a taba fassara wadannan kalmomi (daya a kowace layi)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Sunayen alama da samfurka suna nan yadda suke, tare da kowane inji.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Fassarorin da aka fi so da kuma salon magana a kowane harshe sune fasalolin Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Fassarar da aka fi so (daya kowace layiya: term = translation)','Formality'=>'Girma da mutunci','Default'=>'Na asali','Formal'=>'Na gida da waje','Informal'=>'Ba a tsara ba','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Umarnin salo (marubuta, murya mai alama)','Save glossary'=>'Ajiye ƙamus','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'An fara aikin tare da fassara %d da za a yi. Yana gudana a bangon baya: zaka iya rufe wannan shafin.','Queued again.'=>'An sake saka shi a layin jira.','Running'=>'Yana gudana','Finished'=>'An kammala','Translate in the background'=>'Fassara a baya','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Sanya injin fassara a cikin shafin Injin da farko.','Translate every'=>'Fassara kowane','Into'=>'Zuwa cikin','With'=>'Tare da','Each language’s own engine'=>'Injin kowane harshe da kansa','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Bugaci fassarorin (in ba haka ba za a adana su a matsayin zane-zane)','Estimate the cost'=>'Kiyasta farashin','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Rubutattun posts %1$d, haruffa %2$s. Farashin wannan injin ba a san shi a gaba ba.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d wallafe-wallafe, %2$s haruffa: kimanin $%3$s a kan asusunka.','Start translating'=>'Fara fassarwa','Jobs'=>'Ayuka','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Babu ayyukan fassara tukuna.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Aiki %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d na %2$d an fassara, %3$d ya gaza, %4$d an tsallake (an kiyaye ko riga a cikin wannan harshen)','Stop this job'=>'Dakatar da wannan aikin','See what failed and why'=>'Ga abin da ya gaza da dalili','Content'=>'Abubuwan ciki','Language'=>'Harshe','What went wrong'=>'Abin da ya lalace','Fix it'=>'Gyara shi','Retry with'=>'Sake gwadawa tare da','The same engine'=>'Injin ɗaya','Retry'=>'Maimaita','Translate by hand'=>'Fassara da hannu','Languages and settings'=>'Harsuna da saituna','Engines'=>'Injinuna','Translation jobs'=>'Ayyukan fassara','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ƙara harshe na biyu a ƙarƙashin Tranzly a cikin menu na gudanarwa, kuma maballin canzawa zai bayyana a nan.','Switcher'=>'Mai sauyawa','Accessible label'=>'Alamar da za a iya karantawa','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Canjin harshe','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Hadin gwiwa zuwa wannan shafin a kowane harshe na shafin. Yana nuna komai ba sai an lissafa harsuna biyu ko fiye ba.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Harshe','block keywordswitcher'=>'mai sauyawa','block keywordtranslation'=>'fassara']];